}

# Not written:
#   web-in: the rule is for zone untrust, dmz, and a security rule names no zone: give the networks behind it with --zone-network
#   mail-in: the rule is for zone untrust, dmz, and a security rule names no zone: give the networks behind it with --zone-network
#   office-out: the rule is for zone trust, untrust, and a security rule names no zone: give the networks behind it with --zone-network
#   office-dmz: the rule is for zone trust, dmz, and a security rule names no zone: give the networks behind it with --zone-network
#   admin-ssh: the rule is for zone trust, dmz, lab, and a security rule names no zone: give the networks behind it with --zone-network
#   dmz-syslog: the rule is for zone dmz, trust, and a security rule names no zone: give the networks behind it with --zone-network
#   lab-tools: schedule 'office-hours' is not converted; the rule would apply at all times; the rule is for zone trust, lab, and a security rule names no zone: give the networks behind it with --zone-network
#   lab-out: the rule is for zone lab, untrust, and a security rule names no zone: give the networks behind it with --zone-network
#   ping-dmz: the rule is for zone trust, dmz, and a security rule names no zone: give the networks behind it with --zone-network
#   ipv6-out: the rule is for zone trust, untrust, and a security rule names no zone: give the networks behind it with --zone-network
#   video: no port mapping for application(s) YouTube; supply one with --app-map
#   old-ftp: disabled in the source
#   intrazone default: the rule is for zone pairs, and a security rule names no zone: give the networks behind it with --zone-network
